<title>UK: Centrica to enter UK electricity market.</title>
<headline>Centrica to enter UK electricity market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrica Plc, the gas trading company to be formed through British Gas' planned demerger, is set to enter the UK electricity supply market once it is opened up to competition in 1998.</p>
<p>&quot;We are sure to enter the electricity market,&quot; said Roy Gardner, chief executive designate of Centrica.</p>
<p>But Gardner, speaking at a conference on the British Gas demerger, declined to say what size of market share Centrica was targeting.</p>
